5. PROJECT SCOPE & LIMITATIONS

- Data availability depends on external providers and API connectivity.
- Not all environmental datasets are necessarily integrated into the current prototype.
- Predictive outputs require appropriate data, model validation and testing.
- Satellite observations may have different spatial and temporal resolutions.
- The prototype is intended for environmental information analysis and decision-support exploration, not as a replacement for official scientific or government warnings.

